        "e6be41ee-20da-4204-a057-62aa7ce8bb3f": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "When will my order ship?",
            "content": "<p>Our custom-made pillows, curtains, and table linens are shipped in just 10 days or less! <\/p><p><\/p><p>Our wallpaper is printed-to-order on a continuous bolt and ships in 4 weeks.<\/p><p><\/p><p>Samples ship in 3 business days.<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "c5171506-e8ae-4600-8cdc-03b06738240c": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "title": "I have a question about my order, what should I do?",
            "content": "<p>If you’ve created a profile (and we suggest you do!), you can see all of your previous orders <a href=\"\/account\" title=\"Account page\">here<\/a>. Or, chat with us or shoot an email at <a href=\"mailto:hello@pepper-home.com\" title=\"Email us\">hello@pepper-home.com<\/a>.<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "58ee130e-c010-45d0-8912-b37c43238d75": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What is my shipping cost?",
            "content": "<p>Orders of $300 or more ship for free via FedEx within the Continental US! If your order is smaller, we charge $5-18 depending on the weight. If you are shipping to Canada, Alaska, Hawaii, or Puerto Rico, your shipping cost will appear at checkout. Please note that orders over $550 will require a signature. If you would like to change this, please email us at <a href=\"mailto:hello@pepper-home.com\" title=\"Email us\">hello@pepper-home.com<\/a>.<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "9629f090-d689-4853-bf7c-f18d9c48ec15": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can you ship internationally?",
            "content": "<p>We currently ship to the US and Canada. Looking to ship elsewhere? Send an email to <a href=\"mailto:hello@pepper-home.com\" title=\"Email us\">hello@pepper-home.com<\/a>.<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "a590e06b-a953-4ff2-9811-311759738e13": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How do I track my order?",
            "content": "<p>You will receive an email when your order is shipped that contains tracking information. If you’ve created a profile, your shipping information is found on your <a href=\"\/account\" title=\"Account page\">Orders Page<\/a>.<\/p>"
          }
        }
      },
