    "1633909500d13bfe8e": {
      "type": "accordion-section",
      "blocks": {
        "e2a98ad8-191c-4806-b59f-0a4ec66eab5a": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What is your Return Policy?",
            "content": "<p>Our curtains, pillows, wallpaper, fabric, rugs and tablecloths are <strong>FINAL SALE<\/strong> as they are custom and made-to-order. Once an order is placed, there is a 24-hour window to make any changes. We offer <a href=\"\/collections\/fabric-wallpaper-swatches\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Samples\">samples<\/a> so you can experience the color, pattern, and texture before you purchase.<br\/><\/p><p><\/p><p>We accept returns of unused, unwashed, and undamaged napkins, table runners, and throws within 30 days of the order date.<\/p><p><\/p><p>If you are unhappy with your selections, we will let you exchange your product and choose something else for 50% of the price of new product (offer valid for 30 days after delivery). Offer not valid on Loom & Co X Pepper rugs.<\/p><p><\/p><p>Gift cards cannot be returned.<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "0221843b-2a62-4295-b224-55a5fb62ead9": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What if there is a workroom error?",
            "content": "<p>In the unlikely event that there is a workroom error, we will repair or replace your products right away. Please send a photo and details to <a href=\"mailto:hello@pepper-home.com\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"mailto:hello@pepper-home.com\">hello@pepper-home.com<\/a>.<\/p>"
          }
        }
      },
