    "1633909361ade851bf": {
      "type": "accordion-section",
      "blocks": {
        "53ab79f9-5bbf-4504-8305-e7ada4c860fe": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How do I clean my products?",
            "content": "<p>Please professionally dry clean or spot treat all of your Pepper fabric products. Our cotton fabrics can be steamed; velvets can be brushed but cannot be steamed.<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "fbb14df3-5940-4e4e-8fd0-b526f98898fc": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Where do you make your products?",
            "content": "<p>Made in the USA, we work with our trusted team in the Southern states to produce and sew our textiles. Our wallpaper is printed in Connecticut.<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "20b671c0-87f0-4288-9eb0-809087e7c6ad": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What are your products made out of?",
            "content": "<p>Our cotton textiles are all natural, 100% cotton. Our digital print operation is set up to print natural fiber fabrics with fiber reactive dyes. Fiber reactive dyes are more environmentally friendly than pigment dyes. In addition, all of our fabrics are free of flame retardants and PFAS chemicals.<\/p><p><\/p><p>Our wallpaper is digitally printed in Connecticut with water-based inks on eco-friendly clay-coated paper.<\/p>"
          }
        }
      },
